# Full-cycle delivery (global)

Skill root (prefer in order):

1. `~/.cursor/plugins/local/full-cycle-delivery/skills/full-cycle-delivery`
2. `~/.cursor/skills/full-cycle-delivery`
3. `<repo>/.claude/skills/full-cycle-delivery` (optional workspace override)

- Phases 2–3: **grill-me** then **grill-with-docs** before plan approval
- No Phase 4 without explicit plan approval
- After approval: stay on full-cycle-delivery (playbooks, verify-scope, review prompts)
- Review-fix: coding-reviewer + impact-reviewer → fix until both `FINDING_COUNT: 0`
- No autonomous prod deploy or PR merge
- Pair **research-agent** when external/provider docs are needed
